# Copilot Tools → CRM API Mapping (Detailed)

## Conventions
- All requests JSON; authentication via session cookie or API key; include X-Frappe-CSRF-Token when needed
- Errors: { error_code, message, details? }

## list_docs
- Purpose: list records with filters/sorts/pagination
- Input:
```json
{
  "doctype": "CRM Lead",
  "fields": ["name","first_name","status"],
  "filters": [["CRM Lead","status","=","Open",false]],
  "order_by": "modified desc",
  "limit": 20,
  "offset": 0
}
```
- Endpoint: `crm.api.doc.get_data`
- Output: { data: [...], total?: number }

## get_doc
- Input: { doctype: string, name: string }
- Endpoint: `frappe.client.get`
- Output: full doc JSON

## insert_doc
- Input: { doctype: string, doc: object }
- Endpoint: `crm.api.doc.insert`
- Output: { name: string }

## set_value
- Input: { doctype, name, fieldname, value }
- Endpoint: `crm.api.doc.set_value`
- Output: { ok: true }

## add_comment
- Input: { doctype, name, content }
- Endpoint: `crm.api.comment.add_comment`
- Output: { name }

## email_draft
- Input:
```json
{
  "reference_doctype":"CRM Lead",
  "reference_name":"LEAD-0001",
  "to":"user@example.com",
  "subject":"Intro",
  "html":"<p>Hi...</p>"
}
```
- Endpoint: `crm.api.agent.run` command=`email.draft`
- Output: Communication name (string)

## email_send
- Input: { communication_name }
- Endpoint: `crm.api.agent.run` command=`email.send`
- Output: { ok: true }

## import_rows
- Input:
```json
{
  "title":"Leads Upload",
  "source_type":"CSV",
  "filedata":"<csv text>",
  "mapping_profile":"Leads Quick Import",
  "dedupe":true,
  "sync":true
}
```
- Endpoint: `crm.api.etl.import_rows`
- Output: { accepted: true, job_id }

## job_status
- Input: { job_id }
- Endpoint: `crm.api.etl.job_status`
- Output: { job_id,status,total_rows,processed_rows,error_file,log }

## autogenerate_mapping
- Input: { source_type:"CSV", filedata:"..." }
- Endpoint: `crm.api.etl.autogenerate_mapping`
- Output: { profile: string, items: [...] }

## Deals, Tasks, Calls (via generic CRUD)
- Create Deal: insert_doc with doctype `CRM Deal`
- Create Task: insert_doc with doctype `ToDo`
- Log Call: insert_doc with doctype `CRM Call Log`